  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.5.0: Promoted Silk (OpenCL) backend and BERT-family model layer into Nivara.Extensions; added embeddings frame convention and Microsoft.Extensions.AI glue (NivaraEmbeddingExtensions); real opt-in zero-copy Arrow export for flat primitive columns with validity-bitmap rebuild for null-bearing columns; mask-based nullable column storage (ElementType is now the underlying type); reachable streaming memory budget via AsStream(NivaraExecutionContext); modernbert benchmark selectable lengths/pass counts; qwen distillation on Silk and fused per-token decoder with batched prefill; seedable AutoDiff initializers and constructor-level initializer overrides across conv/VAE/linear modules; documentation citation and snippet gates plus ADR index gate. Core columnar engine unchanged: LINQ-like query engine, tensor-accelerated kernels, lazy/eager/streaming/parallel execution, explicit null masks. Full changelog in CHANGELOG.md.",
